          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox42">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>1. You will note that every person claiming to vote must, before being handed a Ballot-paper, state his name,and,if so desired by the Presiding Officer or Poll Clerk must place a mark against such Elector's name.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox14</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>33.42367cm</Top>
            <Left>0.13041cm</Left>
            <Height>0.94396cm</Height>
            <Width>17.51924cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>14</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <VerticalAlign>Middle</VerticalAlign>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox43">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>CERTIFIED LIST TO BE MARKED</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Center</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox14</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>34.57391cm</Top>
            <Left>2.82726cm</Left>
            <Height>0.6cm</Height>
            <Width>12.12553cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>15</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <VerticalAlign>Middle</VerticalAlign>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox44">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>2. Immediately upon handling a Ballot-paper to an Elector whose name appears unmarked on the certified list of voters, the Presiding Officer or Poll Clerk must place a mark against such Elector's name.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox14</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>35.24447cm</Top>
            <Left>0.13041cm</Left>
            <Height>0.94396cm</Height>
            <Width>17.51924cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>16</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <VerticalAlign>Middle</VerticalAlign>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox45">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
